---
title: Espresso Martini
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, vodka]
source: Classic cocktail, number 5 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

In a #cocktail shaker{}(with ice), pour @vodka{1.5%fl_oz}, @coffee liqueur{0.5%fl_oz}, @espresso{1%fl_oz}(freshly pulled, still warm) and @simple syrup{0.25%fl_oz}. Shake hard for ~{15%seconds} to raise a foam, and double strain into a #coupe glass{}(well chilled). Float @coffee beans{3} on the crema.

> The hard shake is what makes the head; cold-brew concentrate works when there is no espresso machine.
